      "title": "Power draw",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Wall power of each host from its smart plug, written to VictoriaMetrics by Home Assistant's InfluxDB integration (sensor.<entity_id>, unit W). Home Assistant only writes on change, so a steady reading (like gpu-worker at standby) is held until the next change, across gaps of up to 6 hours."
